        "goal": "Make the jump from $2M to $10M in annual revenue feel big and earned.",
        "visualDescription": "Full-screen stat moment. The old figure ($2M) appears small and muted, then the new figure counts up to $10M in large green type. Underneath, a rising line chart of yearly revenue draws left to right and ends on a highlighted final point. A short caption line explains the multiple.",
